Third-party content
-------------------

Fonts: none are bundled or fetched. Every typeface is an operating-system
stack declared in CSS, so nothing here is redistributed.

Word list (js/words.js): 200 common English words, selected for this project.
Individual words in common use are not subject to copyright.

Everything else - the lava lamp, the petals, the chart, the engine and the
themes - was written for this project.
